https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj2/sherpa-onnx-supertonic-3-tts-int8-2026-05-11/tree/cca5a0e6c96e1d2c720986bf7e75fcc81dee3ae4
on request. Supertone publishes the original weights at
https://huggingface.co/Supertone/supertonic-3 under the BigScience OpenRAIL-M
